- [ ] `npm run port -- <screen>`: builds the static page in `outputs/<screen>/app/` (assets copied to `app/assets/`, every key as `data-testid`) and writes `app/BEHAVIOR.md`. Everything for this screen lives in `outputs/<screen>/`.
